            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Season starts</dt>
              <dd>Sept 14</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Practice</dt>
              <dd>6:15pm</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Estimated weekly fee</dt>
              <dd>~$23 per person</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <p class="league-card-status">Space still available</p>
        </li>

        <li class="league-card">
          <h3 class="league-card-eyebrow">Tuesday Night Mixed</h3>
          <p class="league-card-format">4-person teams · USBC sanctioned</p>
          <dl class="league-card-meta">
            <div>
              <dt>Organizational meeting</dt>
              <dd>Sept 8, 6:30pm</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Season starts</dt>
              <dd>Sept 15</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Practice</dt>
              <dd>6:45pm</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Estimated weekly fee</dt>
              <dd>~$23 per person</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <p class="league-card-status">Space still available</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="t2-section" aria-labelledby="leagues-area-h2">
    <div class="t2-section-inner">
      <h2 class="t-eyebrow" id="leagues-area-h2">Service Area</h2>
      <p class="t2-section-body">
        We host league bowlers from across Will County — Plainfield,
        Joliet, Romeoville, Naperville, Shorewood, Lockport, Crest
        Hill, and beyond.
      </p>

      <p class="t2-section-body">
        Want in? <a href="#league-interest">The quick form below</a> gets
        you a callback — or email
        <a href={`mailto:contactus@twistedpin.com?subject=${encodeURIComponent("Bowling League Inquiry")}&body=${encodeURIComponent("Hi,\n\nI'd like to learn more about leagues at Twisted Pin.\n\n")}`}>contactus@twistedpin.com</a>
        or call the front desk.
      </p>

      <p class="t2-section-body">
        Looking for one-time group bookings or fundraisers instead?
        <a href="/events/">See group events →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ============================================================
      LEAGUE INTEREST FORM — added 2026-08-01 (Jon). Lead capture for
      the league coordinator: who they are, solo-or-team, preferred
      night — enough to route the callback without a phone-tag round.
      Posts to /api/league-interest → Resend email to contactus@
      (Freshdesk triage), reply-to the submitter. Sits ABOVE the Pro
      Shop per Jon's placement call.
      ============================================================ */}
  <section class="t2-section" id="league-interest" aria-labelledby="leagues-form-h2">
    <div class="t2-section-inner">
      <p class="t-eyebrow">Get In</p>
      <h2 class="t-display league-section-title" id="leagues-form-h2">
        Tell us you're interested.
      </h2>
